    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d117">

                <pb facs="0208" n="942" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg942"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Baron Fava to Mr. Gresham.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of His Majesty, the King of Italy</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1895-03-16"><hi rendition="#italic">March 16,
                                1895</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of State</hi>:</p>
                <p>I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt of the letters dated respectively the
                    14th, 15th, and 16th instants, by which your excellency was pleased to transmit
                    to me the telegraphic correspondence exchanged between the honorable Department
                    and his excellency the governor of Colorado, in relation to the killing of the
                    Italians at Walsenburg.</p>
                <p>While extending to your excellency my thanks for these courteous communications,
                    and requesting that the aforesaid governor be also thanked, I seize the
                    opportunity of again expressing my firm belief that the Federal Government, as
                    well as the authorities of the State of Colorado, will agree with me upon the
                    necessity there is in bringing before the courts all those who may be found to
                    be guilty of the murder of the Italian subjects.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fava.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
